{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014170","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"在CO-OPS里，武器和装备也可以互相借用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"同伴携带的物品，也能从自己的武器、装备菜单里查看。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"当然，弹药也是共享的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不只是弹药。连<R=　命　,LIFE槽>也是共享的。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=　命　,LIFE槽>","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"AUX_QUESTION_DRIFT_IGNORED; RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对。那时候就是同生共死。对方一死，也就意味着自己死亡。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"要互相交接携带物品，双方必须保持在一定距离内。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我知道。像我这样经验丰富，那段距离简直清清楚楚地看得见，就像一个<R=圈,环>一样。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=圈,环>","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED; RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不愧是Boss。那么，嗯……就把进入那个<R=　　圈　　,CO-OP环>叫作CO-OP IN吧。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=　　圈　　,CO-OP环>","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"}]}